      "source_text": "是「联星」……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "462c36c9c7d482e251304cb432c87a7d5f8084ba89c8ada1313c622a0c51746f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78eddd6196730401569d09a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇迹……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a79273924674fd24cbeb88e4fc5aacbd5e9a9d4251bf0ed106e55e6763640122",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b7233dc53dcdd16f4c9466d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:369d8b4ab0d5aae7d53b73fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "滑过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9279213ec35a62e6c35d0afec46f8b954b4a55c95a649a1deba82383c3801be9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff402d998ea860aac0d9c2c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……还没准备好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "27a5f901d683348f4e7f126c15dac17cb9eb69018bdeeaa23d8931dd3c92435c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b3cfb73d89abaf4ac1e52d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真遗憾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e172f7521a4de44db8fa95e8daa9837967c25aa50f3dd0a6953437efbf46ba63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ae2b98ac49e806c503fe113",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "失去了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d352f851a30079ed5551551818378d8dd8bc012cc479bf9deb50e2410771b83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14a416fbe6c0e3f61f312f97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天是这个。真令人期待呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e50ab3d8d8723191ee985d51dc8d5246e50c26fdd1b89f0fc13d6ce63236a753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d72e4f1af565b29e6d240a0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇怪……存在着……「疲惫」。\r\n似乎会妨碍我正常「活动」……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6fe43cd8e51ae35759c9c696e024f739477bb703ebe1013d5fdc3721500b41b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f9d3f7a55f4a4a75bf77bec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「能量」低落。\r\n身体沉重……我可以顺利完成吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8240277730e0194ab25c5e522bc6a3c7b5b402bbf86cbc6d18fa2491fada9bab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acf9d9fc7e4e602ba3d30e38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新宇宙正呈现最佳数值。\r\n尽管吩咐吧。\r\n无论什么事都存在着「做得到」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38bff59fc67f0024143d5f031741c7868246632a35db05583dc8fcd6c5aebfe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:982362602d951fa51d7afd10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状况步上了「轨道」。\r\n非常良好呢。\r\n我想尝试各种训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca50af1d7a03e75ad507f4782dee98f5b3acbb98aee85c435124bfafa2caede1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c743e664603a9aa0eec7f9f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「信号」显示绿灯。\r\n无论何种「航道」都能顺利前行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb85c871a0fb4796792ef4383ab6501bbdbc589820fb4f8c5a8fc2e9584f44aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12264d8e1b549b255234bf3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心中蕴藏一颗「α星」。\r\n我有预感会带来好结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "951e3a70fbb6fd5679ecdc3feb7e71e7029787e980d1561e2e3b6ae3a691bf3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ac9dbcab0130a081dc31a1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "顺利「维持」着「平稳」。\r\n保持现状继续前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79a673822a4d0ac6bbfa934e676777d0061fdd43aa5c83f4dfc9f4351a04799a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1455e28ade504466bb51d564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「排列」呈现规则状。\r\n也就是「不好不坏」呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c619bfd7c71a6c43ef3269f1e7fa595991543df730ec36f48043bc4ea9b0715",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d61da6ac4443350fb687a128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这道「喷流」不太妙。\r\n有办法重新调整好吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "72474afd4abad48b8c08fc0f8c61e6f66d284d7ad28492ea77c486a0344af7b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:472f7e4289638e92c1a34e4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇怪……「连结」变微弱了……\r\n重新连接……也还是解决不了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "46cec53690e6916c3672f68a8c1f9a1ca774e30380cc7fa832afb744696ef0d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfe683539e50758808977d85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所有「通讯」……都「断绝」了……\r\n……好黑暗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "61d0fb3429a80d4f5e70b3971362036a5b0d0940c24893e39c84e8b5205e8cdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b21b7c6a68e223ba2ad1e264",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「无法控制」。\r\n我无法……迎合自己的思绪……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f07dca100c8b83fd80e34f50fe778813a2765d300fae938caa67248367ab6d4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d91e66188ad25c61db2170e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下场比赛就是第三场了……对吧？\r\n……「想跑步」的意欲正在减退。\r\n生命征象……有点危险。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46af207cb30e3f781dde3b94d536e2e4468f4e0a51be04be1fbbe0682f846ee8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df819c26744108149905c12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参赛会有危险……\r\n再继续下去会接近「致密星」哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de2b3cdb865932d84ba47edca81fa8616dc3ec6685575128b9c62ca223c9c6e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e5ea6fadd4d87a3e4d9c345",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接近「会合」地点了。\r\n新宇宙的「雀跃」\r\n正显示为最大值喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93703b4b2a18cd51f34c88a50dac1702d29df9362fce314e752f003341882e95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b99c7169245b4f87cd0f3e6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无限大的「EVLT」……\r\n「连结」已准备万全。\r\n好期待呀……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1be125f3ce02c0a42449c65647dcefec3f1d4f1c4b446a8f806eaa62f11b9c33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:748f53a3eb725d63f417a601",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "地球重力帮了我一把……\r\n凭借着这股气势进行「重力助推」。\r\n我「似乎能够跑出」最佳表现哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccdaf310d4c1e5c61a63d0f07250942357ebba49c4c43850d38adeeb85ce352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ad5110a3e7fdbff9615b31b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛模拟结果……绿灯。\r\n准备一切顺利喔。\r\n现在就只等起飞了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3f5d1a0ca9fa0a675d51578383ea6abcc4edd7da7fc97a77d86815a17efb7e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2e1b35164f9d6bc0437029a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "意念与体系统整完成。\r\n已连接上「终点」的形象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b232f12ee3b848e580f3ef6fe3cadda613b7e4f25c3224771e29db5a5cab534f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fd06330019b3c1fe0fd60b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整的「向量」相当良好呢。\r\n希望能表现得超乎预测。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a13014b01738a0d8375d75236eb875ead46752bd04365ed42af32256b6616453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3091f3c413db1c6256f6601b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已维持在适当的状态。\r\n接下来只须静待倒数。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6046d6da8f8137941213008a3c43786af59b111ed6777a4bc554665347398954",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab501b216e63cf7685415103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已用肉眼确认到普遍性。\r\n我会一如往常地「奔跑」哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "126f7b8e9e8e189bc9da1d63c8305bd75e5786b493d501ae73056c635d4b2a2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:322fc281261fbb1c2b2ef203",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功维持在预测范围内了呢。\r\n看这稳定程度应该不用担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1ac93405abc51d6a81c3bd65725dae2a82694057b116be45b6c3b420842fede",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de2d1cc50be2d058a7d3015",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态几近红灯呢……\r\n但是比赛不会等人。我会为了\r\n不失去「卫星」而「奔跑」哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aef16d1d475b770bfaef57a3a316198541bf672d4d81aa16fd6008980944eef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebf21a147514c7f621527e63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的时间无法倒流。\r\n我能做的就只有\r\n在目前的条件下「奔跑」了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "784ac36ac5eb6565b3bcb654bebbe9ff72f9b7af91f25d074ed9c5078036d1be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4666acfa458668d81f2756c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "结果没能弥补误差值……\r\n我会注意维持好推进力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13a97e676217e83cf0c9a2dc5d14e0e4d57cb1d6ba0a818d73af035054bcee08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da816139227ded5f864b1c58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当务之急是介入「奇异夸克团」。\r\n我会尽己所能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "581dc454753add545ad9755ff0227797e94ef274ca224b40a30af5de4950fb0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dce7ecbb2452f6ddf07fb091",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是……红色「代码」。看来只能\r\n边继续进行边试图解决了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4ac6fd81e38ec844a5b4d36d88ff24b2c01dd1114be90da24106a763f32b1f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e78cc72a698fd166fa4e952",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "引力不喜欢我。光是维持住\r\n与它的联系就让我用尽全力了。\r\n但我并不想「放弃」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4cf5cf73c6cbf0acfbc7e8802fe7b71e7f9b5e6893d81695759d7f14ea06983",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ae6a11419067996d8350c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即将实行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ca6a5fface5a04c334ef07ee16795559b6e5e2f20ab07ec5c49b1a72c1fcb50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95d8cf7ef2b5a45eb281ea93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要出发啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88d6c890bbf92c9a403ecae7bb42c37fe549b6acc688fd8da61129791123025f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d9f12746c42e39642907d11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a999c2eee042798dcecf9e4199b21371df63e7bac0d2dd1d8a6f4f2928ad197",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8789243ae4ac1cc36eaf173d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "获得学识。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dab368c16c119b0347fa8bddb87dee60e24fb112a5e099e0bd3bd632036935c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa0028f6e1c733328f003947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee2173408f9f3044b3996b0f491f0a70b47af8fe6cce559c323310bfdbe996bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "20042"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
